\newlabel{fig:latency}{{1}{12}{Mean retrieval latency per query. GDT: 26.9\% below TF-IDF ($p{<}0.001$, $d{=}{-4.12}$); 4.0\% below CMA ($p{<}0.001$, $d{=}{-0.87}$). TF-IDF $\approx $ BM25 ($p{=}0.68$)}{figure.1}{}}
